es spin out reams of thought onto punched paper tapes. <br> <br>And in the darkness - in the alleys and the side shops - hide secrets. <br> <br>(Originally entered in the 2003 IF Competition. Re-implemented in Inform 7 for its tenth anniversary, as the original Inform 6 source code was lost.)"}
